    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "8ebc4e7449fff6fd948c80b428b661f2a265823c954015567a35daba262bb805",
      "text": "(PT) Private Transfers + Flight or Overland Connection Duration: Flexible depending on flight or transfer option • Language: English and  Spanish \n\nToday, you’ll say goodbye to Mexico City's vibrant rhythm and set off toward the colorful cultural heart of Oaxaca. \n\nWhether you fly or take the scenic overland route, your journey will be smooth, comfortable, and filled with beautiful glimpses of Mexico’s diverse landscapes. \n\nEither way, adventure awaits as you get closer to Oaxaca’s world of art, flavor, and tradition. \n\nOption 1# \n\nFor a faster and more convenient journey, you can take a direct flight (not included) from Mexico City to Oaxaca. Upon landing, one of our friendly drivers will greet you and take you straight to your hotel in the heart of Oaxaca’s historic center. \n\nFlight Information: \n\nDomestic flights are not included in the program price, but we’re happy to help you with the booking if you wish. The estimated cost is approximately $150 USD per person when purchased in advance. You’re also welcome to book your flight—just let us know your preference, and we’ll take care of the rest. \n\nOption 2# \n\nPrefer a scenic route? Travel by private car from Mexico City to Oaxaca with a cultural stop in Puebla, one of Mexico’s most beautiful colonial cities. \n\nAlong the way, enjoy a relaxing break in Puebla’s historic center, famous for its colorful talavera tiles, Baroque architecture, and vibrant culinary scene. Whether it’s a stroll through its charming streets or a leisurely lunch, this stop adds a meaningful layer to the travel experience before continuing to Oaxaca. \n\nPlease note: This service is transportation only. The driver will take you to the places mentioned, but no entrance fees or guided tours are included. The distance covered is approximately 500 km from Mexico City to Oaxaca. \n\nPrices per person in USD: \n\n| 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6 | 7 | 8 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $ 425 | $283 | $ 213 | $170 | $ 142 | $ 122  | $ 106 |\n\nIncluded: Private Transportation. \n\nNot Included: Certified Bilingual Guide, Meals and Drinks, Tips, Personal Expenses.",
